  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EarthRightsInternational 2020-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EarthRightsInternational 2020-25 - EarthRightsInternational 2020-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisation som arbetar i Mekongregionen f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka lokala samh&#xe4;llens m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter, skydd f&#xf6;r milj&#xf6;n och verka f&#xf6;r klimatr&#xe4;ttvisa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to NGO supporting local communities in the Mekong region to protect their human rights, the Environment and request accountability for the climate crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the intervention is to contribute to the implementation of EarthRights Mekong Regional Program, which is aligned to contribute to the realisation of EarthRight&apos;s global strategic plan 2020-2024.

The Regional goals and objectives of the Mekong Regional Program are:

Regional goal 1 - Climate Justice and Accountability

Regional goal 2 - Earth Rights Defenders

Regional Goal 3 - Corporate Accountability

The program is also intended, to the extent relevant for the Mekong Regional Program, to contribute to four of EarthRights six Global Operational Goals:

1. Gender Justice and Social Inclusion.

2. Development and implementation of Physical and Cyber Security Protection

3. Development of an organisational monitoring and evaluation system  that will include annual planning, data collection and learning processes to inform program design and goal-setting.

4. Increased policy and research capacity through development of human and financial resources and partnerships</narrative>
  </description>
